===Etymology===
{{etymon|en|:inh|enm:Achademia<ety:der<la-cla:acadēmī̆a>>|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|Achademia,achademy,Achademye,achadomye}}, from {{der|en|la-cla|Acadēmī̆a//acadēmī̆a}}, from {{der|en|grc|Ἀκαδημία}}, a grove of trees and gymnasium outside of Athens where [[w:Plato|Plato]] taught; from the name of the supposed former owner of that estate, the [[w:Attica|Attic]] hero [[w:Akademos|Akademos]].<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=n|id=1958661040}}</ref> {{doublet|en|academe|academia|Akademeia}}.

