===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|ambre}}, {{m|enm|aumbre}}, from {{der|en|fro|aumbre}}, {{m|fro|ambre}}, from {{der|en|ar|عَنْبَر|t=ambergris}}, from {{der|en|pal|𐭠𐭭𐭡𐭫|ts=ambar|t=ambergris}}. Compare {{cog|en|lamber}}, {{m|en|ambergris}}. Displaced {{noncog|enm|smulting}} (from {{noncog|ang|smelting|t=amber}}), {{noncog|ang|eolhsand|t=amber}}, {{noncog|ang|glær|t=amber}}, and {{noncog|ang|sāp|t=amber, resin, pomade}}.
