#* {{quote-book|en|title=Dynamics of Plate Interiors|author=A. W. Bally|year=1980|page=49|ISBN=0875905080|passage=In the process of basification, the top layer of the crust becomes basic, while the lower becomes ultrabasic '''acquiring''' the density of the mantle or an even greater density}}
