# {{U|forgetfulness}}; [[cessation]] of [[remembrance]] of wrong; [[oblivion]].
# An act of the [[sovereign]] power [[grant]]ing oblivion, or a general [[pardon]], for a past [[offense]], as to subjects concerned in an [[insurrection]].
