# {{lb|en|legal}} A signed [[document]] wherein an [[affiant]] makes a [[sworn]] statement.
#: {{syn|en|sworn statement|deposition|oath|testimony}}
#: {{ux|en|He submitted his '''affidavit''' rather than appearing to testify in court.}}
